      "filename": "Stunning Scene At Harbour Island Eleuthera Bahamas Imran (55954984).jpeg",
      "title": "File:Stunning Scene At Harbour Island Eleuthera Bahamas Imran (55954984).jpeg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dc/Stunning_Scene_At_Harbour_Island_Eleuthera_Bahamas_Imran_%2855954984%29.jpeg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stunning_Scene_At_Harbour_Island_Eleuthera_Bahamas_Imran_(55954984).jpeg",
      "width": 2048,
      "height": 1486,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 3.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0",
      "artist": "Imran Anwar",
      "description": "500px provided description: I have been blessed to see many beautiful places on this wonderful planet. And the stunning views and colors of the Bahamas and the Caribbean remain among my favorites. \nThe colors of the sky and water constantly change depending on how bright it is, where the sun is shining and what kind of clouds are painting patterns on the water surface. \nCoral Sands is a beautiful hotel to stay at, and the sand under my feet was literally talcum powder soft and sweet pink in color.\nI hope I am blessed to return to this place again.  I hope this photo takes you there for a few moments in time. \nThis photo was taken with a pocket Nikon S6 in 2007. I would love to take pictures with a higher quality Nikon next time I visit.\n? 2007-2013 \n\nDSCN2541 [#peaceful ,#tranquility ,#Nature ,#Travel ,#Nikon ,#Beach ,#Vacation ,#Water ,#Landscapes ,#Blue ,#Sky ,#Clouds ,#Ocean ,#Caribbean ,#Outdoors ,#Bahamas ,#Marine ,#S6 ,#IMRAN ,#ImranAnwar]",
      "dateCreated": "25 November 2007, 17:09:26 (UTC)",
      "categories": [
